<br />
Judges in this round were Bryn Anderson, Emily Huang, Chantelle Pianetta, Trendlyon Veal, Markus Smith, Joel Torgeson, KP Rutland, Jim Minty, Trudy Thatcher and Keerigan Rudd.    </div></section>

